== Provenance ==

WiiLand is a ground-up rewrite and extension maintained by PhilosophiMoonbeam
(https://github.com/PhilosophiMoonbeam), derived from the xwiimote project
originally written by David Herrmann (dh.herrmann@gmail.com).

The original project copyright notice is retained in LICENSE. Copyright in
newly authored WiiLand material remains with its respective authors; all such
material is distributed under the same terms unless a file states otherwise.

